/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 46 0 R
/T (The Writer is the first robot. It starts at the entrance, without a pre-existing map. The current implementation uses a hardware abstraction layer so the decision logic is independent from the physical hardware interface. Planned hardware: Arduino UNO Q; RPLIDAR, Modulino Movement \(LSM6DSOX\), Modulino Distance \(VL53L4CD ToF\), servo-based beacon dispenser, and a thermal sensor to be selected \(MLX90640\). A wheelled drive base, wheel encoders, motor driver, battery and emergency stop are also planned, with exact parts still to be finalized.)
/E (The Writer is the first robot. It starts at the entrance, without a pre-existing map. The current implementation uses a hardware abstraction layer so the decision logic is independent from the physical hardware interface. Planned hardware: Arduino UNO Q; RPLIDAR, Modulino Movement \(LSM6DSOX\), Modulino Distance \(VL53L4CD ToF\), servo-based beacon dispenser, and a thermal sensor to be selected \(MLX90640\). A wheelled drive base, wheel encoders, motor driver, battery and emergency stop are also planned, with exact parts still to be finalized.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
