/Title (Our Phase 1 working scenario is a Fire / Hazardous Building. The Writer Robot enters first, explores without a pre-existing map, detects safety-relevant conditions, and leaves information behind in beacons. The information can later be recovered through the Outside Network and used to brief an Executor Robot.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2328 0 R
/Prev 2388 0 R
